WEBVTT

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.750
"Starlight Festival"

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:31.290
<i>We'll make it shine...</i>

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:35.540
<i>This "miracle"</i>

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:49.250
<i>It's what I think we'll call these days</i>

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:53.870
<i>We've run desperately</i>

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:58.040
<i>If it's somewhere that anyone can get to</i>

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:03.200
<i>They wouldn't call us being here</i> a miracle, right?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.500
<i>Revolution days.</i>

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.290
<i>If you come to a stop</i>

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.160
<i>Break the limits.</i>

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.660
<i>You won't be able to go beyond</i>

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.750
<i>We can make new ways.</i>

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.080
<i>Now, let's start</i>

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.450
<i>Just face to face.</i>

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:16.790
<i>Toward that... unending sky</i>

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.410
<i>Right now, what we're making resound</i>

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:27.370
<i>(All through the days.)</i> Is an ensemble where we make each other better

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:32.040
<i>If we don't improve ourselves,</i> then we can't shine

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:41.790
<i>(We're beyond the sky.)</i> It's what we'll call the stars... a "miracle"

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:56.620
"December S1 Proposal"

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:01.500
"December S1 Proposal"
"Episode 22: Starlight Festival"

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:50.200
"Starlight Festival"

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:15.660
"Band Club"

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:20.870
♪ Without warning...
a soft breeze ruffles my hair ♪

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:27.200
♪ Come closer... this way,
it's as if it's beckoning me ♪

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:31.750
♪ Even knowing it will never be permitted ♪

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.540
♪ It grows in my heart... ♪

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:40.660
♪ From the vessel that contains
my devotion to you ♪

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.830
♪ Ah... it spills over ♪

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.790
♪ (Dear Moon Light) ♪

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.790
♪ I don't want to be illuminated ♪

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.580
♪ (Moon Light) ♪

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.790
♪ For I'll find myself faded away ♪

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.790
♪ I wear the pitch black NIGHT. ♪

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:57.080
♪ I want to protect you
like a shadow pressed close ♪

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:01.750
♪ With this "Silent Oath,"
I hereby swear a pure and noble eternity ♪

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:12.040
♪ Remaining never-uttered...
words hidden away in my heart ♪

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:19.620
♪ The key I turned to lock myself away
when I swore my sword to you is ♪

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:26.290
♪ An oath that proudly aches ♪

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.950
♪ At the mercy of the passage of time ♪

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.830
♪ For now ♪

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.040
♪ We'll jump out of
the Joyful×Box! (Oh, Yes!) ♪

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.200
♪ Don't be afraid ♪

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:12.120
♪ It's okay, open it up! ♪

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.330
♪ A glittering... ♪

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:17.120
♪ The sky looks the same as always ♪

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.910
♪ I wonder about that ♪

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:23.370
♪ It should already look different
to your eyes (Just for you) ♪

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.700
♪ It should be different ♪

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.660
♪ That's right, Magic for your "Switch" ♪

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:34.450
♪ Make party time colorful, with a set list
made of tracks of everyone's smiles ♪

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:37.950
♪ Look, connect with sympathy ♪

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.830
♪ We're the turntables! ♪

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:47.410
♪ I'm sure the sun will rise
to protect our dreams ♪

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:52.750
♪ We'll even turn sparkles
into power and evolve ♪

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:57.500
♪ I won't let you get away, it's maddening ♪

00:17:57.500 --> 00:18:02.290
♪ We call each other with our instincts,
you're already in my arms (in my arms) ♪

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:07.080
♪ Desire has no need to hesitate ♪

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:11.500
♪ Just jump in with your bare feet
(into the dark) ♪

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.950
♪ UNDEAD WORLD ♪

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:19.330
♪ We'll give you all the more excitement
for making you wait ♪

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:23.910
♪ The curtains are up!
LET'S CLAP YOUR HEART BEAT ♪

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.700
<i>Like how those slender shoulders that act tough</i>

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:08.040
<i>Saved me unexpectedly</i>

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.500
<i>Your gentle voice</i>

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.120
<i>Softly touches my heart</i>

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:14.580
<i>This innocent love</i>

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.790
<i>How many times has it saved me</i>

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:20.450
<i>Given me strength</i>

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:23.500
<i>My loyalty</i>

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.120
<i>Quietly</i>

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:27.410
<i>Begins to heat up</i>

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.660
<i>I want to protect that smile</i>

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:33.040
<i>--From now on</i> --I want to support that future

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:36.410
<i>--Now and forever</i> --Connecting to eternity

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.830
<i>We'll always be with you</i>

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:51.290
<i>No matter what awaits you</i> beyond the door you walk through

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.910
<i>It's okay</i>

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:59.450
<i>Even if I can't find the words</i> to express how I feel

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:10.120
<i>Let me swear, I lift up these "Promise Swords"</i> of my affection for you

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:17.040
<i>To you</i>

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:39.080
"Starlight Festival"

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:49.000
♪ We'll smile when we're happy ♪

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:51.910
♪ And yes, sometimes get hurt ♪

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:55.040
♪ We'll share
the same feelings ♪

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:57.290
♪ And head to tomorrow ♪

00:22:57.290 --> 00:23:00.120
♪ Come on, make the dream come true ♪

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:02.870
♪ Transcend the conventional rules ♪

00:23:02.870 --> 00:23:08.120
♪ Because there are songs
that can redraw the world... ♪

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:14.000
♪ Here in our hands ♪

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:16.370
♪ Go further than anyone else! ♪

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:19.160
--♪ (So higher star) ♪
--♪ To where the hope gleams ♪

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:21.080
--♪ (Reach for the star) ♪
--♪ Become constellations ♪

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:22.750
--♪ (Reach for the star) ♪
--♪ twinkling to each other ♪

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.160
♪ Trickstar ♪

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:27.500
♪ Go way! With the light that begins here ♪

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:30.660
--♪ (Starting the life) ♪
--♪ With the light called "possibility" ♪

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:37.660
♪ The Rebellion Star will change the future ♪

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:44.000
"Trickstar, win the SS!"

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:49.000
"Episode 23"
"Effort"
